<Layout title="About CaretDev"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT CARETDEV</span><h1>We believe the IRIS ecosystem <span class="accent-text">can be more connected.</span></h1><p class="lede">CaretDev is an independent engineering company focused on modernising the developer experience and integration ecosystem around InterSystems technologies.</p></div></section><section class="content-section"><div class="container two-col"><div><span class="eyebrow">OUR POINT OF VIEW</span><h2>Powerful infrastructure deserves modern tooling.</h2></div><div class="rich-text"><p>Critical systems often outlive their original technology stack. InterSystems IRIS has long been used to support demanding workloads, but teams increasingly need to connect those systems to today's languages, data platforms, development practices and cloud services.</p><p>We build tools that close those gaps—and provide specialist engineering when integrations, reliability or modernisation become difficult.</p><p>Our open-source projects make that mission tangible, while our emerging product work explores new capabilities such as journal-based change data capture.</p><p>CaretDev is based in the United States and works with teams using InterSystems technologies.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="https://github.com/caretdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">See our work on GitHub ↗</a></div></div></section><CTA /></Layout>
